.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="A direct link between chemistrykit.md and chemistrykit.statmech: molecular dynamics produces an actual ensemble of particle velocities, and statistical mechanics predicts what their distribution should look like at equilibrium. After a short equilibration run, an LJFluid&#x27;s particle speeds are histogrammed and compared against chemistrykit.statmech.MaxwellBoltzmannSpeedDistribution evaluated at the simulation&#x27;s own (instantaneous, measured) temperature -- no fitting involved.">

